{"reference":"Matthew 8","book":"Matthew","chapter":8,"status":"pending","sections":[{"kind":"interpretive_questions","title":"Healing and spirits","blocks":[{"id":"block_1","text":"Matthew 8 places healings alongside the casting out of demons. These scenes are presented within ancient understandings of bodily suffering and spirits, so the chapter’s descriptions should be read in that setting without assuming that every condition receives a modern diagnostic explanation.","verse_refs":["Matthew 8:1-34"],"provenance_refs":["reader_path_matthew_008_19bc2af024dc33a75c406cda"],"confidence":"high","interpretation_level":"disputed"}]}],"generated_metadata":null}